---
title: "{{ character.name }}"
subtitle: "{{ character.character_class }} Level {{ character.level }}"
author: "{{ character.player_name or 'Player' }}"
date: "{{ now().strftime('%Y-%m-%d') }}"
format:
  pdf:
    documentclass: dndbook # This assumes Quarto can find or is configured with the dndbook class
    mainfont: Gillius ADF No2
    monofont: Fira Code
    link-citations: true
    lof: true
    lot: true
    geometry: "letterpaper,twocolumn,margin=1in"
    header-includes:
      - \usepackage[utf8]{inputenc}
      - \usepackage{multicol}
      - \usepackage{dnd}
      - \usepackage{dndbook}
      - \usepackage{longtable}
      - \usepackage[shortlabels]{enumitem}
      - \usepackage[T1]{fontenc}
      - \usepackage{luatexja}
      - \usepackage{gilliusadf} # If using specific fonts
      - \usepackage{kpfonts}
      - \usepackage{microtype}
      - \usepackage{etoolbox}
      - \usepackage{graphicx}
      - \usepackage{xcolor}
      - \usepackage{colortbl}
      - \usepackage{hologo}
      - \usepackage{hyperref}
      - \hypersetup{colorlinks=true,linkcolor=red,urlcolor=blue}
      # This part for dndbook custom commands might be tricky, Quarto might not process it easily
      # If dndbook.cls is not found by quarto, it might need to be explicitly placed or configured.
      # For now, assume a basic LaTeX setup.
execute:
  echo: false
---

# {{ character.name }}

## Character Details

| **Field**          | **Value**                                    |
|:-------------------|:---------------------------------------------|
| **Class**          | {{ character.character_class }}              |
| **Level**          | {{ character.level }}                        |
| **Race**           | {{ character.race }}                         |
{% if character.background %}
| **Background**     | {{ character.background }}                   |
{% endif %}{% if character.alignment %}
| **Alignment**      | {{ character.alignment }}                    |
{% endif %}{% if character.experience_points > 0 %}
| **Experience**     | {{ "{:,}".format(character.experience_points) }} XP |
{% endif %}

## Ability Scores

| **Ability**   | **Score** | **Modifier** | **Save**                                        | **Prof?** |
|:--------------|:----------|:-------------|:------------------------------------------------|:----------|
| Strength      | {{ character.ability_scores.strength }}     | {{ "%+d"|format(character.ability_scores.strength_modifier) }}     | {{ "%+d"|format(character.get_saving_throw(Ability.STRENGTH)) }}     | {% if Ability.STRENGTH in character.saving_throw_proficiencies %}Yes{% else %}No{% endif %} |
| Dexterity     | {{ character.ability_scores.dexterity }}    | {{ "%+d"|format(character.ability_scores.dexterity_modifier) }}    | {{ "%+d"|format(character.get_saving_throw(Ability.DEXTERITY)) }}    | {% if Ability.DEXTERITY in character.saving_throw_proficiencies %}Yes{% else %}No{% endif %} |
| Constitution  | {{ character.ability_scores.constitution }} | {{ "%+d"|format(character.ability_scores.constitution_modifier) }} | {{ "%+d"|format(character.get_saving_throw(Ability.CONSTITUTION)) }} | {% if Ability.CONSTITUTION in character.saving_throw_proficiencies %}Yes{% else %}No{% endif %} |
| Intelligence  | {{ character.ability_scores.intelligence }} | {{ "%+d"|format(character.ability_scores.intelligence_modifier) }} | {{ "%+d"|format(character.get_saving_throw(Ability.INTELLIGENCE)) }} | {% if Ability.INTELLIGENCE in character.saving_throw_proficiencies %}Yes{% else %}No{% endif %} |
| Wisdom        | {{ character.ability_scores.wisdom }}       | {{ "%+d"|format(character.ability_scores.wisdom_modifier) }}       | {{ "%+d"|format(character.get_saving_throw(Ability.WISDOM)) }}       | {% if Ability.WISDOM in character.saving_throw_proficiencies %}Yes{% else %}No{% endif %} |
| Charisma      | {{ character.ability_scores.charisma }}     | {{ "%+d"|format(character.ability_scores.charisma_modifier) }}     | {{ "%+d"|format(character.get_saving_throw(Ability.CHARISMA)) }}     | {% if Ability.CHARISMA in character.saving_throw_proficiencies %}Yes{% else %}No{% endif %} |

*Proficiency Bonus:* At level {{ character.level }}, the proficiency bonus is **{{ "%+d"|format(character.proficiency_bonus) }}**.

## Combat Stats

| **Field**          | **Value**                       |
|:-------------------|:--------------------------------|
| **Armor Class**    | {{ character.armor_class }}     |
| **Initiative**     | {{ "%+d"|format(character.initiative) }} |
| **Speed**          | {{ character.speed }} ft.       |
| **Hit Points**     | {{ character.current_hit_points }}/{{ character.max_hit_points }}{% if character.temporary_hit_points > 0 %} (+{{ character.temporary_hit_points }} temp){% endif %} |
| **Hit Dice**       | {{ character.hit_dice }}        |
{% if character.inspiration %}
| **Inspiration**    | Yes                             |
{% endif %}

## Skills

| **Skill**                 | **Bonus**                               | **Prof?** |
|:--------------------------|:----------------------------------------|:----------|
{% for skill in ALL_SKILLS %}
| {{ skill.value.replace("_", " ").title() }} | {{ "%+d"|format(character.get_skill_modifier(skill)) }} | {% if skill in character.skill_proficiencies %}*{% endif %} |
{% endfor %}

{% if character.spellcasting_ability %}
# Spellcasting

| **Field**             | **Value**                                    |
|:----------------------|:---------------------------------------------|
| **Class**             | {{ character.character_class }}              |
| **Ability**           | {{ character.spellcasting_ability.value.title() }} |
| **Save DC**           | {{ character.spell_save_dc }}                |
| **Attack Bonus**      | {{ "%+d"|format(character.spell_attack_bonus) }} |

## Prepared Spells

{% set prepared_spells = character.spellbook.get_prepared_spells_by_level() %}

{% if prepared_spells[0] %}
### Cantrips
{% for spell in prepared_spells[0] | sort(attribute='name') %}
*   {{ spell.name }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}

{% for level in range(1, 10) %}
{% if prepared_spells[level] %}
### Level {{ level }} Spells
{% for spell in prepared_spells[level] | sort(attribute='name') %}
*   {{ spell.name }}{% if spell.ritual %} (Ritual){% endif %}{% if spell.concentration %} (C){% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}

# Spellbook

{% for spell in character.spellbook.get_prepared_spells() %}
## {{ spell.name }}
*   **Level**: {% if spell.level == 0 %}{{ spell.school.value }} Cantrip{% else %}{{ spell.level }}{{ 'st' if spell.level == 1 else ('nd' if spell.level == 2 else ('rd' if spell.level == 3 else 'th')) }}-level {{ spell.school.value }}{% endif %}
*   **Casting Time**: {{ spell.casting_time }}
*   **Range**: {{ spell.range }}
*   **Components**: {{ spell.components_str }}
*   **Duration**: {{ spell.duration }}{% if spell.concentration %}, concentration{% endif %}

{{ spell.description }}

{% if spell.higher_levels %}
*   **At Higher Levels**: {{ spell.higher_levels }}
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}

